<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AMP says cuts stake in MIM. [corrected 01:32 gmt]</title>
<headline>RTRS-AMP says cuts stake in MIM. [corrected 01:32 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and first paragraph to show AMP has reduced its stake, not sold all of its 5.34 stake)</p>
<p>Australian Mutual Provident Society (AMP) revealed on Thursday it had reduced its stake in base metals miner MIM Holdings Ltd to 4.9 percent from 5.34 percent previously.</p>
<p>The company said it sold the shares during ordinary trade last Friday.</p>
<p>At 10.50 a.m. (0050 GMT), MIM shares were three cents lower at A$1.60.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
